#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:75
msgid "[1] The eligible Trust Network Participant (TNP) has to submit its Statement of Interest [link to the form. [Document 5] ] to gdhcn-support@who.int ."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:127
msgid "[10] Create the GPG keys per environment and per each user needed."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:133
msgid "[11] The TNP creates the private GitHub repositories per environment"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:140
msgid "[12] Upon GitHub repository creation and invitation to GitHub bot user to WHO is sent, validity for accepting this invitation is 7 days by default. If no action is taken it loses validity."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:142
msgid "[13] Invitation for GitHub bot user must be accepted by WHO within 7 days since invitation was emitted."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:155
msgid "[14] TNP is ready for onboarding according to WHO requirements and governance and has collected the following information in the Letter of Application [Document 16]:"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:165
msgid "[15] The Letter of Application is received and processed by WHO."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:167
msgid "[16 - 17] The verification and confirmation of the named people that are allowed to provide the key material for the TNP takes place through either of different channels:"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:176
msgid "[18] WHO acknowledges the Letter of Application and proceeds to validate the provided data. At this stage verification of rules compliance takes place. Verification is in detailed according to process and individuals involved in the request."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:178
msgid "[19] In case the compliance rules verification failed, WHO need to inform the TNP by email."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:77
msgid "[2 – 3] WHO validates all provided data and verify that such a data follows WHO compliance with Trusted Network Terms of Participation (TOP 0 – 3) https://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html as well as: Participant´s eligibility criteria, governmental entity/health agency, contact details of approvers and individuals. [See Elegibility Criteria]. [Document 16]"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:180
msgid "[20] The TNP receive an email with information indicating that validations failed. Corrective activities have to be taken."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:182
msgid "[21] WHO is checking for each provided GPG key, if the given email address is included in the GPG key."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:184
msgid "[22] Validate that GPG key matches cryptographic/governance criteria"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:190
msgid "[23] WHO is collecting the required information to be provided to the operations team (OPS):"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:229
msgid "[30] The collected onboarding information is sent to the operations (OPS) team. The onboarding (OB) team is informed as well."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:231
msgid "[31 - 35] The onboarding data is taken over to the configuration files by the OPS team to automate the GitHub processes. As a result, a Pull Request (PR) is created. Dependent on the environment, the subsequent steps differ."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:233
msgid "[36 -37] For PROD environment, the PR is verified by WHO. After successful verification, the air-gapped signing process is performed to sign the keys. Follow to [47]"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:235
msgid "[38] For UAT (and optional DEV), an auto signing process signs the keys."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:237
msgid "[39] The service provider checks the PR as well."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:81
msgid "[4 - 5] In case no compliance with WHO governance rules is given, the application is rejected. The rejection is communicated to the TNP by email."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:241
msgid "[40 - 41] In case the verification failed, WHO is informed about the outcome."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:245
msgid "[42] Correction."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:279
msgid "[43] In case the verification was successful the whitelisting of the certificates is initiated."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:283
msgid "[44 - 46] and the participant will be informed that the preparation has been completed successfully."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:239
msgid "[47] TSI Verification of Pull Request in PROD Environment."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:243
msgid "[48 - 50] In case Pull Request failed, TSIS to communicate to Participant for them to Correct"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:83
msgid "[6] TNP needs to modify the data they shared with WHO and re-apply it."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:287
msgid "[60] The participant is connecting to UAT environment and the following steps has to be performed to check the connection:"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:330
msgid "[61] In case the connection fails, some corrective actions must be performed to analyze and solve the issue(s). The operations team is supporting the TNP."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:334
msgid "[62] After the connection to the TNG is established the participant can start the dry run test on UAT."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:393
msgid "[63] After executing all required steps, the participant must provide the test results to the onboarding team."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:397
msgid "[64 - 65] The onboarding team checks the results and provides feedback to the participant."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:401
msgid "[66] In case of any issues additional corrective actions are bespoken and solved with the participant."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:281
msgid "[67] If the Dry Run Test has passed successfully, the whitelisting of the certificates in the gateway (PROD environment) continues."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:285
msgid "[68 - 69] The Onboarding team informs the TNP to be ready to connect to TNG PROD environment."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:85
msgid "[7] If the WHO’s technical team gives a positive opinion, the eligible Trust Network Participant will be invited to start the onboarding process. The following information is included:"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:328
msgid "[70] The participant is allowed and enabled to connect to TNG PROD environment (for detailed information see [60])."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:332
msgid "[71] In case the connection fails, some corrective actions must be performed to analyze and solve the issue(s). The operations team is supporting the TNP."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:350
msgid "[72] After the connection to the TNG PROD is established the Production Readiness Test can start."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:395
msgid "[73 - 74] After executing all required steps, the participant must provide the test results to the service provider by mail."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:399
msgid "[75] The service provider checks the results."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:403
msgid "[76] and in case of any issues additional corrective actions are bespoken and solved with the participant."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:266
msgid "[77 - 80] After passing the Production Readiness Test, the participant is allowed to use the TNG PROD environment. A confirmation email is sent to the participant and to WHO with the confirmation about the successfully passed test and the completion of the onboarding process."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:91
msgid "[8] The TNP receives the confirmation and necessary technical information to connect to the TNG and register the certificates."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:106
msgid "[9] Create certificates per environment. Details can be found here: https://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_CertificatePreperation.html"
msgstr ""

